# The gate scripts in scripts/ run on Linux runners, where a CRLF shebang is "bad interpreter", and the
# mod sources are LF. A contributor whose git has core.autocrlf=true would otherwise hand both to the
# repository with CRLF. Only the listed types are touched — nothing is renormalized wholesale.
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
